The '''Kiffar''' were a [[near-human]] [[species]]<ref name="VosSWE" /> from the [[planet]]s [[Kiffu]] and [[Kiffex]]. Although they seemed [[human]] in appearance,<ref name="Kiffar" /> Kiffar were distinguished by their [[Color|scarlet]] [[blood]]<ref name="Dark Disciple" /> and facial tattoos, which indicated their clan affiliation on their species' [[homeworld]]s.<ref name="Kiffar" /> [[Jedi Master]] [[Quinlan Vos]], who took part in the [[Clone Wars]], was a [[Gender|male]] [[Jedi Master]] Kiffar.<ref name="VosDB">{{Databank|quinlan-vos|Quinlan Vos}}</ref> [[Vildar Mac]] was also a [[Jedi]] Knight during [[The High Republic]].<ref name="The High Republic (2022) 1">[[The High Republic (2022) 1|''The High Republic'' (2022) 1]]</ref> A small number of the species, including Vos, possessed the gift of [[psychometry]], the ability to read the memories of inanimate objects through touch.<ref name="Alien Archive">''[[Star Wars: Alien Archive]]''</ref>

